desc(
	mode: "struct"
	language: "java"
	title: "Struct scan: Java ObjectInputStream"
	title_zh: "结构扫描：Java ObjectInputStream 反序列化"
	type: vuln
	level: high
	rule_id: "struct-java-objectinputstream"
	risk: "deserialization"
	desc: <<<DESC
### 规则说明
检测到 ObjectInputStream 构造。反序列化不可信字节流可导致任意代码执行。

### 风险类型
deserialization

### 影响
该用法属于已知危险 API 或弱密码学原语，若处理外部数据或用于安全场景，可能导致命令执行、代码执行、反序列化或机密性破坏。

### 检测方式
结构扫描在编译单元内匹配真实调用，而不是注释或字符串字面量。
DESC
	solution: <<<SOLUTION
### 修复建议
避免原生 Java 序列化；如必须使用，配合白名单 ObjectInputFilter。
SOLUTION
	alert_min: 1
	"file://Ser.java": <<<POS
import java.io.InputStream;
import java.io.ObjectInputStream;
class Ser {
  Object bad(InputStream in) throws Exception {
    return new ObjectInputStream(in).readObject();
  }
}
POS
	"safefile://SerSafe.java": <<<NEG
class SerSafe {
  void ok() {
    System.out.println("json");
  }
}
NEG
)

ObjectInputStream(* as $in) as $call
alert $call for {
	level: "high",
	title: "ObjectInputStream Call",
	title_zh: "ObjectInputStream 调用",
	message: "结构扫描：Java ObjectInputStream 反序列化",
	risk: "deserialization",
}
